+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use a Least Recently Used (LRU) eviction policy with a time-to-live (TTL) of 300 seconds. It was chosen because it gives a cleaner, more straightforward mental model that is easier to reason about and maintain.
